stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  state "Closed" as s0
  state "Open" as s1
  state "Half-open" as s2
  s1 --> s2: Execution requested [Recovery delay elapsed] / Reserve trial slot and start supplied work
  s2 --> s0: Trial counted successful [Same recovery cycle] / Close and release waiting executions
  s2 --> s1: Trial counted failed [Same recovery cycle] / Restart backoff and release waiting executions
  note right of s2
    Shared breaker role#59; default single trial. Static<br/>interpretation. Other transitions are omitted.
    Success and failure here are breaker classifications.<br/>An error outside the handled failure policy can count<br/>as recovery success while still being delivered to its<br/>caller.
  end note
